Cell["\<\
Truncation keeps the largest Schmidt values at each bond. At a chosen bond, \
the kept values are a prefix of the Schmidt spectrum of the original state:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->194828199,ExpressionUUID->"c1e0babb-934a-46a4-b48f-249080698ffc"],

